flowchart TD
  T[Incoming support ticket] --> V[Validate input and load session]
  V --> C[bitext-v2 classifier]
  C --> H[Classifier handoff\nintent, domain, confidence, margin]
  H --> R{Deterministic routing policy}

  R -->|Low confidence or missing information| CL[Clarify\nask question and save state]
  CL --> SS[(Session state store)]
  SS -. user follow-up .-> V

  R -->|Unsupported request or policy boundary| ES[Escalate\nrecord reason and hand off]
  ES --> AU[(Audit log)]

  R -->|Accepted intent| SR[Skill registry]
  SR --> SK[Select versioned skill]
  SK --> PC{Check preconditions\nand required entities}
  PC -->|Missing entity| CL
  PC -->|Precondition failed| ES
  PC -->|Ready| TR[Tool registry]

  TR --> AL[Allowlist and permission check]
  AL -->|Rejected| ES
  AL -->|Permitted| TL[Typed simulated tool]
  TL --> RES{Tool result}
  RES -->|Success| EV[Validate structured evidence]
  RES -->|Failure| RT{Retry limit reached?}
  RT -->|No| TL
  RT -->|Yes| ES

  EV --> GR[Grounded response template]
  GR --> AU
  EV --> SS
  SS --> OUT[Reply or workflow completion]

  subgraph Skills[Project skills]
    S1[Order status]
    S2[Refund status]
    S3[Invoice retrieval]
    S4[Delivery-address change]
  end
  SR --- S1
  SR --- S2
  SR --- S3
  SR --- S4

  subgraph Tools[Project-created simulated tools]
    T1[lookup_order]
    T2[lookup_refund]
    T3[retrieve_invoice]
    T4[validate_delivery_address]
  end
  TL --- T1
  TL --- T2
  TL --- T3
  TL --- T4
